flowchart TD
  A[Observed error] --> B{Offshore timing wrong?}
  B -- yes --> C[Check source geometry and bathymetry]
  B -- no --> D{Offshore amplitude wrong?}
  D -- yes --> E[Check source model and kinematics]
  D -- no --> F{Nearshore amplitude wrong?}
  F -- yes --> G[Check Manning n and terrain fidelity]
  F -- no --> H[Check Local3D coupling, turbulence and geometry]
